activation/gradient safeguards and Residual Cross-Attention integration.

Wan/Diffusers/Transformers,gsplat,fused-ssim and LPIPS are external dependencies,
not relicensed by this repository. Downloaded model weights and DL3DV data remain
subject to their respective upstream terms; they are not distributed in this Git tree.
FlashWorld initialization retains only the pretrained latent-velocity transformer;
its Gaussian-feature output channels and reconstruction decoder are not used.

